<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Grinaker half year pre-excep shr rises.</title>
<headline>Grinaker half year pre-excep shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Pre-excep shr, attrib (cts)  39.9     vs 35.9</p>
<p>    Post-excep shr (cts)	   35.2     vs 41.8</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 6.0	   vs 9.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   56.70	 vs     63.81</p>
<p>    Tax			 15.59	 vs     16.77</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    4.40	 vs	3.83</p>
<p>    Interest received     18.84	 vs	7.43</p>
<p>    Turnover	     1,076.62	 vs  1,042.62</p>
<p>Full name: Grinaker Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	2.89 loss   vs     6.30 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - The firm said it would give out dividend dates in due course. The group added that it was cautiously optimistic about prospects for the rest of the current financial year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
